  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5e0c62854ba04e2469dfb7ea4953b1a9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 4Nisan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  etiket: dayc
  aciklama:
  - "Nisan'\u0131n \u0130ngilizcesi olan April, Latince aperire, a\u011Fa\xE7lar\u0131n
    \xE7i\xE7ek a\xE7maya ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131 mevsimi ima eder. \u0130nce
    d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFClm\xFC\u015F isimleri sever misin?"
  - "Yaz haz\u0131rl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131n ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131 ay bu.
    Ekilen bitkiler do\u011Frudan g\xFCne\u015F \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131na
    maruz kalmas\u0131n diye nisan ay\u0131nda g\xF6lgeleme \xF6rt\xFCleri kullan\u0131l\u0131r
    ve bu ay mine, ate\u015F \xE7i\xE7e\u011Fi, karanfil, schefflera, g\xFCnd\xFCz
    sefas\u0131, petunya, godetya, y\u0131ld\u0131z \xE7ad\u0131r\u0131, cam g\xFCzeli
    ekilir."
  aranacakEtiket: dgun
